<title>USA: HitCom sets Internet-related service unit.</title>
<headline>HitCom sets Internet-related service unit.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>HitCom Corp said Monday it established a new subsidiary that will offer Internet-based marketing services to businesses.</p>
<p>The new Intellisource Network division will set up city-specific business and information resources on the Internet, a national commerce and information tool later this year and a Web site marketing, design and hosting company called Spark!, the company said.</p>
<p>HitCom is a marketing and technology company.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
